A. does H-NEW-150's residual arm reproduce, and what is it measuring?
========================================================================================
published residual rho = +0.0859
reproduced here        = +0.0859   (delta +0.000000)
raw rho reproduced     = +0.3121  (published +0.3121)

the score has 87 tied zeros out of 114.
  before residualising they are ONE tied rank; after, they occupy 66 distinct values,
  spanning -1.1488 to -0.4221, ordered rho = +1.0000 with log verses.
  Residualising a zero-inflated score against length therefore REPLACES the ties with a
  pure length ordering, and the residual correlation is then partly a length-vs-degree
  correlation on 87 surahs that carry no liturgical information at all.

  rank-based partial Spearman controlling log verses = +0.3174 (p=0.0006)
  against the published OLS-on-raw-values residual of +0.0859
  The two disagree, and the rank-based one does not manufacture order among the ties.

  formal substitution F1_naming   : raw rho=-0.0556  residual rho=+0.1012
  formal substitution quotation   : raw rho=+0.0217  residual rho=+0.0158
